(c4) Te(h) lu(hg)cis(fvED) an(g)te(hj) tér(ji)mi(h)num,(i) (::) Re(k)rum(k) Cre(i)á(ji)tor,(h) pó(ih)sci(g)mus,(h) (:) Ut(k) só(k)li(i)ta(k) cle(klk)mén(ji)ti(hg)a(hiHG) (;) Sis(i) præ(jk)sul(i) ad(ji) cu(h)stó(ih)di(g)am.(h) (::) 2. Pro(h)cul(hg) re(fvED)cé(g)dant(hj) sóm(ji)ni(h)a,(i) (::) Et(k) nó(k)cti(i)um(ji) phan(h)tás(ih)ma(g)ta:(h) (:) Ho(k)stém(k)que(i) no(k)strum(klk) cóm(ji)pri(hg)me,(hiHG) (;) Ne(i) pol(jk)lu(i)án(ji)tur(h) cór(ih)po(g)ra.(h) (::) 3. Ma(h)rí(hg)a,(fvED) Ma(g)ter(hj) grá(ji)ti(h)æ,(i) (::) Ma(k)ter(k) mi(i)se(ji)ri(h)cór(ih)di(g)æ,(h) (:) Tu(k) nos(k) ab(i) ho(k)ste(klk) pró(ji)te(hg)ge,(hiHG) (;) Et(i) ho(jk)ra(i) mor(ji)tis(h) sú(ih)sci(g)pe.(h) (::) 4. Gló(h)ri(hg)a(fvED) ti(g)bi,(hj) Dó(ji)mi(h)ne,(i) (::) Qui(k) na(k)tus(i) es(ji) de(h) Vír(ih)gi(g)ne,(h) (:) Cum(k) Pa(k)tre et(i) San(k)cto(klk) Spí(ji)ri(hg)tu,(hiHG) (;) In(i) sem(jk)pi(i)tér(ji)na(h) sǽ(ih)cu(g)la.(h) (::) A(hih)men.(gh) (::)
